      "nextStartLine": null,
      "content": "483|# Adventure Rewards\n484|\n485|**1200 XP each** for completing the adventure and resolving the fate of the trapped souls. This is a challenging Tier 1 adventure reward under [[Character Advancement]].\n486|\n487|**150 gp each** from the [[N.E.R.D]] scholar for investigating the tomb and returning with evidence. This payment is divided among the characters who complete the contract.\n488|\n489|Additional rewards:\n490|\n491|- **100 gp** for each intact inert Jar of Souls recovered for [[Skarguther Dungleboof]].\n492|- **300 gp** for each intact active Jar of Souls recovered for Skarguther.\n493|- Up to **1,400 gp total** from Skarguther if all six jars are recovered intact; this is a party payment, not a reward per character.\n494|- Approximately **450–700 gp** worth of treasure found throughout the dungeon, divided among the party.\n495|- **2 Potions of Healing.**\n496|- **3 low-level spell scrolls.**\n497|- A story award for uncovering [[Dopendis Gravebreath]], the Orcus cult, and the Great Working.\n498|\n499|Optional bonus XP:\n500|\n501|- **+50 XP each** for rescuing or laying to rest the souls of the missing adventurers.\n502|- **+100 XP each** for recovering reliable evidence of the Orcus cult’s soul experiments.\n503|\n504|If the characters complete only part of the adventure, use the partial-XP guidelines in [[Character Advancement]].\n505|\n506|## Future Hook: Dopendis Gravebreath Returns\n507|\n508|Don't have Dopendis Gravebreath attack immediately.\n509|\n510|Weeks or even months later, the characters discover the symbol of the **hand holding the flaming horned skull** somewhere else.\n511|\n512|Perhaps on a corpse.\n513|\n514|Perhaps in another abandoned laboratory.\n515|\n516|Perhaps carried by someone asking questions about the adventurers who entered the tomb near [[Doobius House]].\n517|\n518|Eventually they learn the truth:\n519|\n520|**Dopendis Gravebreath knows their names, and surviving members of his wider Orcus network know that the characters have found the jars of Soul Diesel.**",
