      "content": "485|# Adventure Rewards\n486|\n487|**1200 XP each** for completing the adventure and resolving the fate of the trapped souls. This is a challenging Tier 1 adventure reward under [[Character Advancement]].\n488|\n489|**150 gp each** from the [[N.E.R.D]] scholar for investigating the tomb and returning with evidence. This payment is divided among the characters who complete the contract.\n490|\n491|Additional rewards:\n492|\n493|- **100 gp** for each intact inert Jar of Souls recovered for [[Skarguther Dungleboof]].\n494|- **300 gp** for each intact active Jar of Souls recovered for Skarguther.\n495|- Up to **1,400 gp total** from Skarguther if all six jars are recovered intact; this is a party payment, not a reward per character.\n496|- Approximately **450–700 gp** worth of treasure found throughout the dungeon, divided among the party.\n497|- **2 Potions of Healing.**\n498|- **3 low-level spell scrolls.**\n499|- A story award for uncovering [[Dopendis Gravebreath]], the Orcus cult, and the Great Working.\n500|\n501|Optional bonus XP:\n502|\n503|- **+50 XP each** for rescuing or laying to rest the souls of the missing adventurers.\n504|- **+100 XP each** for recovering reliable evidence of the Orcus cult’s soul experiments.\n505|\n506|If the characters complete only part of the adventure, use the partial-XP guidelines in [[Character Advancement]].\n507|",
