      "content": "1|\n2|_A D&D 5e (2024) adventure for 4–5 4th-level characters_\n3|\n4|The characters have already survived the supernatural disaster beneath [[Blacklung Quarry]] and the soul experiments in the tomb beyond [[Doobius House]]. Now, someone is trying to recover what those adventures left behind.\n5|\n6|A sealed shipment has vanished from the road between [[Doobius House]] and [[Nevercough Island]] in the [[Grim Forest]]. Its manifest lists ordinary mining equipment, but the cargo is actually a set of empty soul vessels, alchemical glassware, and a handwritten account of the cult’s next objective. The shipment was meant to help rebuild the cult's operation after [[Sarbrindar]] was defeated in the quarry and Dopendis Gravebreath’s laboratory was exposed.\n7|\n8|The characters must find the shipment, determine who is behind it, and stop the cult from beginning a new Soul Diesel distillation before the stolen equipment reaches its destination.\n9|\n10|## Adventure Summary\n11|\n12|1. The characters receive a public contract at the [[FLS Guildhall]], and any characters that were involved in the previous adventures have the option of taking a post from [[The Roach Clip]].\n13|2. They investigate an abandoned wagon and follow the shipment’s trail.\n14|3. They search a temporary cult waystation and recover the **Ash Ledger**.\n15|4. They travel to a ruined pumping station beneath the forest.\n16|5. They interrupt the cult’s attempt to restart the Soul Diesel process.\n17|6. They decide what to do with the captured cultist, the surviving equipment, and the Ash Ledger.\n18|\n19|\n20|",
