      "content": "1|# The Last Batch\n2|\n3|_A D&D 5e (2024) adventure for 4–5 4th-level characters_\n4|\n5|The characters have already survived the supernatural disaster beneath [[Blacklung Quarry]] and the soul experiments in the tomb beyond [[Doobius House]]. Now, someone is trying to recover what those adventures left behind.\n6|\n7|A sealed shipment has vanished from the road between [[Doobius House]] and [[Nevercough Island]] in the [[Grim Forest]]. Its manifest lists ordinary mining equipment, but the cargo is actually a set of empty soul vessels, alchemical glassware, and a handwritten account of the cult’s next objective. The shipment was meant to help rebuild the cult's operation after [[Sarbrindar]] was defeated in the quarry and Dopendis Gravebreath’s laboratory was exposed.\n8|\n9|The characters must find the shipment, determine who is behind it, and stop the cult from beginning a new Soul Diesel distillation operation before the stolen equipment reaches its destination.\n10|\n11|## Adventure Summary\n12|\n13|1. The characters receive a public contract at the [[FLS Guildhall]], and any characters that were involved in the previous adventures have the option of taking a post from [[The Roach Clip]].\n14|2. They investigate an abandoned wagon and follow the shipment’s trail.\n15|3. They search a temporary cult waystation and recover the **Ash Ledger**.\n16|4. They travel to a ruined pumping station beneath the forest.\n17|5. They interrupt the cult’s attempt to restart the Soul Diesel process.\n18|6. They decide what to do with the captured cultist, the surviving equipment, and the Ash Ledger.\n19|\n20|## Adventure Rewards\n21|\n22|**900 XP each** for completing the adventure: recovering the stolen shipment, stopping the cult from restarting the Soul Diesel process, and deciding what becomes of the Ash Ledger. This is a long Tier 1 adventure reward under [[Character Advancement]].\n23|\n24|**175 gp each** from the [[Free League of Stickyickistan]] for recovering the shipment and returning with reliable evidence of the cult’s activity. This payment is divided among the characters who complete the contract.\n25|\n26|Additional rewards:\n27|\n28|- **100 gp total** from [[N.E.R.D]] if the party turns over the Ash Ledger, intact alchemical notes, or other useful research evidence.\n29|- **50 gp total** for recovering salvageable alchemical glassware or mining equipment from the stolen shipment.\n30|- Any mundane equipment recovered from defeated cultists or the waystation, subject to DM approval.\n31|- A story award for uncovering the cult’s attempt to rebuild the Soul Diesel operation after [[Sarbrindar]] and [[Dopendis Gravebreath]] were defeated or exposed.\n32|\n33|Optional bonus XP:\n34|\n35|- **+50 XP each** for capturing a cultist alive for questioning.\n36|- **+50 XP each** for preserving the Ash Ledger instead of destroying it.\n37|- **+100 XP each** for preventing any new Soul Diesel distillation from being completed.\n38|\n39|If the characters complete only part of the adventure, use the partial-XP guidelines in [[Character Advancement]].\n40|\n41|---\n42|\n43|",
