      "content": "1|[[Unit BH-Umbra Δ9]] has been arrested. An up and coming ragtag heist crew of the [[Ashen Shadow Society]] has been assigned to break them out.\n2|\n3|I want to convert the adventure \"Prisoner 13\" from the book Keys From the Golden Vault where the Ashen Shadow Society is acting as the patron. Instead of trying to get a key from a prisoner, they actually have to break out 4 prisoners. The players will be playing both as the heist crew, and as the prisoners that need to be broken out. The heist crew is 4 level 4s, and the prisoners are 4 level 8s.\n4|\n5|# The 4 Prisoners of A.S.S.C.U.N.T\n6|\n7|_An Adventure for four 4th-level infiltrators and four 8th-level prisoners_\n8|\n9|[[Unit BH-Umbra Δ9]], better known as A.S.S.C.U.N.T., the [[Ashen Shadow Society Creature Utilisation & Neutralisation Taskforce]], has been arrested and imprisoned in one of Stickyickistan’s most secure detention sites. The [[Ashen Shadow Society]] cannot risk leaving the taskforce in custody, but sending its veteran operatives directly into the prison would expose the Society’s hand. Instead, an ambitious new heist crew is assigned the impossible job: infiltrate the prison, locate the prisoners, disable enough of the facility’s defenses, and create a window for A.S.S.C.U.N.T. to break out from the inside.\n10|\n11|In this adventure, the players control both sides of the operation: a ragtag 4th-level Ashen Shadow heist crew working their way into the prison from outside, and the 8th-level prisoners of A.S.S.C.U.N.T. fighting, scheming, and surviving from within. Success requires both teams to act independently, coordinate through limited signals, and turn the prison’s own security systems against it before the facility locks down for good.",
